size is shown.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Thermoplastic Check Valve</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide thermoplastic check valves, <MET>8 mm</MET><ENG> 0.25 inch</ENG> through<MET> 400 mm</MET><ENG> 16 inch</ENG>, of a [Y-check] [ball-check] design, 
manufactured of [polyvinyl chloride (PVC)] [chlorinated polyvinyl chloride (CPVC)] [polypropylene (PP)] [polyvinylidene 
fluoride (PVDF)] [_____] with [flanged] [socket] [threaded, in accordance with <MET><RID>ASME B1.20.2M</RID></MET><ENG><RID>ASME B1.20.1</RID></ENG>,] end 
connections.  Use valves that are rated for [<MET>1.03 MPa</MET><ENG> 150 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service.  Provide valves with 
[fluoro-elastomeric O-ring] [_____] seals and seats.  [Fit discs with a polyvinyl chloride (PVC) coil guide.]  
[Caps must be of hex design.]</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Double Disc Swing Check Valve</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Double disc swing check valves, <MET>50 mm</MET><ENG> 2 inch</ENG> through<MET> 1300 mm</MET><ENG> 52 inch</ENG>, must be wafer style, spring loaded swing 
check valve, with a [cast iron] [ductile iron] [carbon steel] [bronze] [TP316 stainless steel] [_____] body, 
