rated for [<MET>1.4 MPa</MET><ENG> 200 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 60 degrees C</MET><ENG> 140 degrees F</ENG> and valves<MET> 350 mm</MET><ENG> 14 inch</ENG>
 through<MET> 1300 mm</MET><ENG> 52 inch</ENG> are rated for [<MET>1.03 MPa</MET><ENG> 150 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 60 degrees C</MET><ENG> 140 degrees 
F</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
