[_____] trim, [butadiene acrylonitrile] [_____] seat, and [bronze] [stainless steel] [_____] springs.  
Ensure valves are rated for [<MET>1.4 MPa</MET><ENG> 200 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 60 degrees C</MET><ENG> 140 degrees 
F</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Silent check valves, <MET>65 through 1050 mm</MET><ENG> 2.5 through 42 inch</ENG>, must be globe style, center guided valve 
