 threaded] [<RID>ASME B16.5</RID> flanged] ends, and [cast iron] [ductile iron] [carbon steel] [bronze] [TP316 stainless 
steel] [polyvinyl chloride (PVC)] [_____] bodies with a cleanout and [floating] [sinking] type [hollow steel] 
[phenolic] [butadiene acrylonitrile covered metal] ball.  [Flanges must be <RID>ASME B16.1</RID> Class [125] [_____].]  
