[_____],] [_____] bodies, [bolted] [_____] bonnets, single [styrene butadiene rubber] [polypropylene] [_____] 
wedge discs, [non-rising] [rising] stems, and [flanged] [threaded, in accordance with <MET><RID>ASME B1.20.2M</RID></MET><ENG><RID>ASME B1.20.1</RID></ENG>
