as seats] [_____] seals, and [lever] [gear] [_____] [pneumatically actuated] [electrically actuated] operators.  
Ensure valves are rated for [<MET>1.03 MPa</MET><ENG> 150 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 60 degrees C</MET><ENG> 140 degrees F</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
