to indicate diaphragm position.  Valves must be rated for [<MET>1.03 MPa</MET><ENG> 150 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 60 
degrees C</MET><ENG> 140 degrees F</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
