(PTFE)] [_____] seals, and that are [manually] [pneumatically] [_____] actuated.  [Pneumatically operated valves 
must be [fail-closed] [fail-open] [double acting].]  Provide position indicators to indicate diaphragm position.  
Valves must be rated for [<MET>1.03 MPa</MET><ENG> 150 psig</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> MPa</MET><ENG> psig</ENG>] service at<MET> 20 degrees C</MET><ENG> 68 degrees F</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
