valves] [globe valves] [ball valves] [_____].  For pipelines [<MET>50 mm</MET><ENG> 2 inch</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> mm</MET><ENG> inch</ENG>] and smaller, provide 
[<MET>13 mm</MET><ENG> 1/2 inch</ENG>] [[_____]<MET> mm</MET><ENG> inch</ENG>] drains equipped with [gate valves] [globe valves] [ball valves] [_____].</TXT><BRK/>
