] [<RID>ASME B16.1</RID>] Class [_____] flanged inlet with outlet.  Fit air and vacuum valve with blowoff valve, quick disconnect 
couplings, and a minimum<MET> [2] [_____] m</MET><ENG> [6.6] [_____] feet</ENG> of hose in order to permit back flushing after installation 
