assembly is rated for<MET> [1.03] [_____] MPa</MET><ENG> [150] [_____] psig</ENG> working pressure at<MET> 65 degrees C</MET><ENG> 150 degrees F</ENG>.  
Provide assembly meeting the requirements of [<RID>ASSE 1015</RID>] [<RID>AWWA C510</RID>].</TXT><BRK/>
